A lazy marker line's definition defines nothing, in any container

```
> r
> - [d]: u

[go][d]
.
<blockquote><p>r
- [d]: u</p></blockquote>
<p>[go][d]</p>
```

```
::: n
r
- [d]: u
:::

[go][d]
.
<div class="n">
  <p>r
- [d]: u</p>
</div>
<p>[go][d]</p>
```

```
> r
> - [^f]: t

see[^f]
.
<blockquote><p>r
- [^f]: t</p></blockquote>
<p>see[^f]</p>
```

```
> - [d]: u

[go][d]
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li></li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<p><a href="u">go</a></p>
```

```
> r
>
> - [d]: u

[go][d]
.
<blockquote>
  <p>r</p>
  <ul>
    <li></li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<p><a href="u">go</a></p>
```
